{"abstract":"The National Science Foundation (NSF) is announcing plans to renew this collection. In accordance with the requirements of the Paperwork Reduction Act of 1995, we are providing opportunity for public comment on this action. After obtaining and considering public comment, NSF will prepare the submission requesting Office of Management and Budget (OMB) clearance of this collection for no longer than 3 years.","action":"Notice.","agencies":[{"id":366,"json_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/api/v1/agencies/366","name":"National Science Foundation","parent_id":null,"raw_name":"NATIONAL SCIENCE FOUNDATION","slug":"national-science-foundation","url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/agencies/national-science-foundation"}],"body_html_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/html/2022/04/01/2022-06902.html","cfr_references":[],"citation":"87 FR 19142","comment_url":null,"comments_close_on":"2022-05-31","correction_of":null,"corrections":[],"dates":"Written comments on this notice must be received by May 31, 2022 to be assured consideration. Comments received after that date will be considered to the extent practicable. Send comments to address below.","disposition_notes":null,"docket_ids":[],"dockets":[{"agency_name":"NSF","documents":[{"allow_late_comments":null,"comment_count":0,"comment_end_date":"2022-06-01","comment_start_date":"2022-04-01","comment_url":"https://www.regulations.gov/commenton/NSF_FRDOC_0001-2901","id":"NSF_FRDOC_0001-2901","regulations_dot_gov_open_for_comment":false,"updated_at":"2023-02-28T12:21:09.015-05:00"}],"id":"NSF_FRDOC_0001","supporting_documents":[],"supporting_documents_count":0,"title":"Recently Posted NSF Rules and Notices."}],"document_number":"2022-06902","effective_on":null,"end_page":19143,"executive_order_notes":null,"executive_order_number":null,"full_text_xml_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/full_text/xml/2022/04/01/2022-06902.xml","html_url":"https://www.federalregister.gov/documents/